{
  "name": "final-hpo",
  "notes": "The finalist fit. The cross-zoo selector (ADR-0106) names the winner by max mean path score over the three pinned compare artifacts, and the finalist stage trains THAT candidate \u2014 this document never restates a model name. The window is the locked calendar's final_hpo phase: fit through 2025-11-30, one embargo session, select on 2025-12-02..2026-02-28. No walkforward section: the phase declares no fold schedule, so this is one fit, not a rolling series. Nothing at or after the 2026-03-01 lockbox is readable. This document SELECTS hyperparameters and is spent by doing so; it is not a performance claim and it promotes nothing.",
  "pipeline": {
    "universe": {
      "uses": "intraday_equities-universe",
      "params": {
        "path": "configs/universe-p13-pooled.json"
      }
    },
    "source_a": {
      "uses": "intraday_equities-bars",
      "params": {
        "root": "./ob",
        "source": "alpaca-sip-split",
        "universe": "configs/universe-p13-pooled.json",
        "start_ms": 1514764800000,
        "sessions": [
          "rth"
        ],
        "shared_fields": [
          "symbol",
          "ts"
        ]
      },
      "notes": "alpaca-sip-split holds eleven P10 names and SPY; SPY is the reference every group build reads from this source under its own group universe bound."
    },
    "source_c": {
      "uses": "intraday_equities-bars",
      "params": {
        "root": "./ob",
        "source": "alpaca-sip-split-c",
        "universe": "configs/universe-p13-pooled.json",
        "start_ms": 1514764800000,
        "sessions": [
          "rth"
        ],
        "shared_fields": [
          "symbol",
          "ts"
        ]
      }
    },
    "source_d": {
      "uses": "intraday_equities-bars",
      "params": {
        "root": "./ob",
        "source": "alpaca-sip-split-d",
        "universe": "configs/universe-p13-pooled.json",
        "start_ms": 1514764800000,
        "sessions": [
          "rth"
        ],
        "shared_fields": [
          "symbol",
          "ts"
        ]
      }
    },
    "source_e": {
      "uses": "intraday_equities-bars",
      "params": {
        "root": "./ob",
        "source": "alpaca-sip-split-e",
        "universe": "configs/universe-p13-pooled.json",
        "start_ms": 1514764800000,
        "sessions": [
          "rth"
        ],
        "shared_fields": [
          "symbol",
          "ts"
        ]
      }
    },
    "pooled": {
      "uses": "concat",
      "inputs": {
        "a": "$source_a.records",
        "c": "$source_c.records",
        "d": "$source_d.records",
        "e": "$source_e.records"
      },
      "params": {
        "shape": "records",
        "provenance_waiver": "Each immutable MarketRecord already carries its source; the five symbol namespaces are disjoint and checked below.",
        "key": "symbol",
        "consume_inputs": true
      },
      "notes": "Only source groups containing the 25 selected names are read; their symbol namespaces are disjoint and source_a also supplies SPY."
    },
    "features": {
      "uses": "intraday_equities-session-features",
      "inputs": {
        "records": "$pooled.merged",
        "spec": "$universe.spec"
      },
      "params": {
        "lookback": 20,
        "layout": "columns",
        "dtype": "float32",
        "include_klines": true,
        "cache_dir": "./pipeline_cache/p13-features-f32-kronos-v1",
        "momentum_horizons": [
          {
            "width": 3,
            "tag": "3m",
            "cross_session": false
          },
          {
            "width": 120,
            "tag": "2h",
            "cross_session": true
          },
          {
            "width": 180,
            "tag": "3h",
            "cross_session": true
          },
          {
            "width": 780,
            "tag": "2s",
            "cross_session": true
          },
          {
            "width": 1950,
            "tag": "1w",
            "cross_session": true
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "scan": {
      "uses": "intraday_equities-no-information-scan",
      "inputs": {
        "records": "$features.records",
        "bars": "$features.tape",
        "spec": "$universe.spec"
      },
      "params": {
        "split": "val",
        "train_end_ms": "$splits.train_end_ms",
        "train_start_ms": "$splits.train_start_ms",
        "val_start_ms": "$splits.val_start_ms",
        "val_end_ms": "$splits.val_end_ms",
        "label_scale": "vol",
        "label_residual": "SPY",
        "label_residual_self": "raw",
        "fit_symbols": [
          "LLY",
          "QQQ",
          "XLF",
          "XLE",
          "XLK",
          "BAC",
          "SMH",
          "IWM",
          "XBI",
          "FCX",
          "DAL",
          "NRG",
          "MET",
          "MSTR",
          "NOW",
          "LULU",
          "PANW",
          "INTC",
          "CIEN",
          "LRCX",
          "TER",
          "BIDU",
          "LITE",
          "ADBE",
          "ANET"
        ],
        "lead_start": 1,
        "lead_step": 1,
        "lead_stop": 1,
        "score_period_ms": 1800000,
        "estimator": "lightgbm.LGBMRegressor",
        "estimator_params": {
          "n_estimators": 800,
          "learning_rate": 0.005,
          "num_leaves": 4,
          "max_depth": 2,
          "min_child_samples": 2000,
          "reg_lambda": 100.0,
          "reg_alpha": 0.1,
          "subsample": 0.5,
          "subsample_freq": 1,
          "colsample_bytree": 0.3,
          "n_jobs": 8,
          "random_state": 0,
          "verbosity": -1
        },
        "score_symbols": [
          "LLY",
          "QQQ",
          "XLF",
          "XLE",
          "XLK",
          "BAC",
          "SMH",
          "IWM",
          "XBI",
          "FCX",
          "DAL",
          "NRG",
          "MET",
          "MSTR",
          "NOW",
          "LULU",
          "PANW",
          "INTC",
          "CIEN",
          "LRCX",
          "TER",
          "BIDU",
          "LITE",
          "ADBE",
          "ANET"
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "splits": {
    "kind": "time",
    "train_end_ms": 1764547199000,
    "val_start_ms": 1764633600000,
    "val_end_ms": 1772323199000,
    "test_end_ms": 1772323199001,
    "notes": "configs/program-calendar.json is the authority; these are its final_hpo dates in epoch ms. train_end 2025-11-30T23:59:59Z, the 2025-12-01 embargo session, val 2025-12-02..2026-02-28T23:59:59Z. test_end sits one millisecond past val_end so the band is empty by construction: the lockbox opens at 2026-03-01 and this phase may not read it."
  },
  "tracking": {
    "sinks": [
      {
        "kind": "dskit.pipeline.libs.mlflow:MlflowTracker",
        "params": {
          "tracking_uri": "sqlite:///mlruns.db",
          "experiment": "intraday_equities"
        },
        "notes": "Local sqlite beside the invoking cwd."
      }
    ],
    "notes": "Excluded from identity - where metrics land is not what it computes."
  },
  "outputs": {
    "run_root": "./pipeline_runs"
  },
  "stages": {
    "calendar": {
      "uses": "dskit.pipeline.program_calendar:ProgramCalendar",
      "params": {
        "path": "program-calendar.json",
        "phase": "final_hpo"
      },
      "notes": "The locked calendar gates the phase and its asof; the splits above are its dates."
    },
    "select": {
      "uses": "dskit.pipeline.benchmarks:BenchmarkSelect",
      "params": {
        "decision_metric": "mean",
        "select": "max",
        "sources": [
          {
            "id": "p16-lean",
            "path": "../pipeline_runs/p16-feature-mask-zoo-staged-2026-02-28-98635601/stages/compare.json",
            "sha256": "f29bbfa51b1c84bf5e686d9c63c39637d0b1e8f70116ab2a69f6d894a729061c"
          }
        ]
      },
      "notes": "ADR-0115: the ONE pinned P16 feature-mask-zoo comparison (docs/decisioning/actions.csv row A18850, the canonical non-ephemeral path repair superseding the earlier /tmp-rooted A18839 reference), replacing the prior three-zoo (P13/P14/P15) comparison now that model-family and feature-mask selection are closed (master plan Sec.2: `lean-pooled-h10` is locked). With exactly one source, BenchmarkSelect's existing max-mean-score mechanism deterministically names it — no new selection code. Read-only and never promoting."
    },
    "memory": {
      "uses": "intraday_equities.modelability_study:MemoryPreflightStage",
      "params": {
        "memory_limit_bytes": 18253611008,
        "groups": {
          "a": {
            "universe": "configs/universe-p12-a.json",
            "sources": [
              "source_a"
            ]
          },
          "c": {
            "universe": "configs/universe-p12-c.json",
            "sources": [
              "source_a",
              "source_c"
            ]
          },
          "d": {
            "universe": "configs/universe-p13-d-selected.json",
            "sources": [
              "source_a",
              "source_d"
            ]
          },
          "e": {
            "universe": "configs/universe-p13-e-selected.json",
            "sources": [
              "source_a",
              "source_e"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "notes": "Build four bounded P13 group caches containing the frozen P12 feature matrix, label tape, and causal five-minute OHLCVA bars. The P12 caches remain untouched because write-once cache identity changes when K-lines are added. Groups D and E use P13 cohort-only universes plus SPY so unused P12 breadth candidates cannot inflate peak memory."
    },
    "finalist": {
      "uses": "intraday_equities.model_zoo:FinalistCandidate",
      "inputs": {
        "preflight": "$memory.passed",
        "caches": "$memory.groups",
        "selection": "$select.selection"
      },
      "params": {
        "gate3_artifact": "../pipeline_runs/p12-g3-recovery-staged-2026-02-28-a1f293a2/stages/gate3_recovery.json",
        "gate3_sha256": "098b21eaef6ee0260753d4f981ca2337bccae406b9efd394284d9b180ba03bd0",
        "cache_groups": [
          "a",
          "c",
          "d",
          "e"
        ],
        "templates": [
          {
            "id": "lean",
            "family": "pooled-lightgbm",
            "representation": "pooled-tabular-native-category",
            "feature_policy": "all frozen P12 features except the exact P16 lean-mask drop (33 columns, pinned below and by tests/test_configs.py against intraday_equities.final_model.lean_feature_drop()); symbol_code is native categorical",
            "feature_source": "tabular",
            "seed_policy": "fixed seed 0; ADR-0115 evidence-mode selection over the same 24-trial purged inner CandidateInventory draw",
            "compute_class": "cpu-medium",
            "compute_rank": 1,
            "enabled": true,
            "model": {
              "estimator": "dskit.pipeline.libs.sklearn.ColumnSubsetEstimator",
              "estimator_params": {
                "estimator": "lightgbm.LGBMRegressor",
                "drop": [
                  "after_holiday",
                  "amihud_3s",
                  "dow_cos",
                  "dow_sin",
                  "mom_1w",
                  "mom_2s",
                  "mom_3s",
                  "month_cos",
                  "month_sin",
                  "range_3s",
                  "ret_1w",
                  "ret_2s",
                  "ret_3s",
                  "ret_lag_10",
                  "ret_lag_11",
                  "ret_lag_12",
                  "ret_lag_13",
                  "ret_lag_14",
                  "ret_lag_15",
                  "ret_lag_16",
                  "ret_lag_17",
                  "ret_lag_18",
                  "ret_lag_19",
                  "ret_lag_5",
                  "ret_lag_6",
                  "ret_lag_7",
                  "ret_lag_8",
                  "ret_lag_9",
                  "rv_1w",
                  "rv_2s",
                  "rv_3s",
                  "session_gap_days",
                  "vol_3s"
                ],
                "n_estimators": 600,
                "learning_rate": 0.01,
                "num_leaves": 8,
                "max_depth": 3,
                "min_child_samples": 1000,
                "reg_lambda": 100.0,
                "reg_alpha": 0.1,
                "subsample": 0.7,
                "subsample_freq": 1,
                "colsample_bytree": 0.5,
                "n_jobs": 8,
                "random_state": 0,
                "verbosity": -1
              },
              "hpo_trials": 24,
              "hpo_seed": 0,
              "hpo_val_days": 63,
              "hpo_embargo_days": 5,
              "hpo_objective": "squared_error_improvement",
              "hpo_evidence": true,
              "hpo_space": {
                "learning_rate": [
                  0.003,
                  0.01,
                  0.03
                ],
                "num_leaves": [
                  4,
                  8,
                  16
                ],
                "min_child_samples": [
                  500,
                  1000,
                  2000,
                  4000
                ],
                "reg_lambda": [
                  10.0,
                  100.0,
                  1000.0
                ],
                "reg_alpha": [
                  0.0,
                  0.1,
                  1.0
                ]
              }
            },
            "notes": "ADR-0115: model-family and feature-mask selection are closed (master plan Sec.2), so the torch-mlp candidate is removed and this is the ONLY finalist recipe. estimator wraps ColumnSubsetEstimator around the same LightGBM the space was built for (2026-09-06 research, docs/research/zoo-feature-selection-and-hpo/), applying the exact P16 lean drop (docs/memos/p16-feature-mask-and-final-gate-results.md) so training reads the identical 33-fewer-column feature set P16 selected on. hpo_objective is squared_error_improvement (never IC, master plan Sec.2) with hpo_evidence=true, so per-lead selection runs ADR-0114 SS11 item 1's one-standard-error rule over a complete trial ledger instead of a raw argmin/argmax; hpo_trials/hpo_seed/hpo_val_days/hpo_embargo_days/hpo_space are UNCHANGED from the prior 'ic'-objective recipe \u2014 same 24-of-324 frozen inventory, same inner cuts. This template's id is 'lean' (not the prior 'lgbm'), matching P16's own winning candidate's mask-family component (P16 memo line 37) so FinalistCandidate's own id-plus-horizon-suffix recipe lookup resolves to the real winner BenchmarkSelect names -- this document restates no full candidate name itself. intraday_equities.final_model.hpo_space() was updated in the same change to match this template by family == 'pooled-lightgbm' rather than a fixed id, since id is now the finalist's candidate-name component, not a stable lookup key for the generic HPO-grid reader."
          }
        ],
        "path_protocol": {
          "forecast_strategy": "direct_per_lead",
          "horizon_weighting": "equal_asset_equal_within_asset",
          "fit_universe": "all_gate3_passers_each_lead",
          "score_universe": "certified_horizon_includes_lead"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Builds the finalist document for whichever candidate the selector named, and refuses by name if this document declares no recipe for it. One document, no walkforward, the splits above."
    }
  }
}
